From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 01:30:41 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] tests: Expect zoom, pan and Fit All in the arrangement view

One step of the wheel with Ctrl held must scale every screen in the view
by 1.25 and keep the point under the pointer where it is; a step back
must undo it, and the wheel without Ctrl must not zoom. Dragging the
empty view with the left button, or anywhere with the middle button,
must move every screen by the drag. Neither may change a screen's place
in the configuration. Fit All, in the view's menu, must bring back the
view where every screen fits after zooming and panning.

They fail here, where the view has neither zoom nor pan.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
